ttle of Plataea</span><span class="tp">Battle · 479 BCE</span></span></a></li><li><a href="/encyclopedia/battle-of-the-eurymedon"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/battle-of-the-eurymedon.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="44" height="44"><span><span class="nm">Battle of the Eurymedon</span><span class="tp">Battle · c. 466 BCE</span></span></a></li></ul></section>
